---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | aBlog by Satirr">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="markdown-body" style="margin-top: 24px;">
      <p>I write here about software engineering, minimalist web craft, and technical experiments I am exploring.</p>
      
      <p>This blog is constructed around simplicity, readable typography, and quick rendering without superfluous overhead.</p>

      <blockquote>
        Clear ideas executed with restraint remain more valuable and pleasant to use than intricate, noisy features.
      </blockquote>

      <p>If you have thoughts or feedback on any piece, feel free to join the discussion in the comments section below each post.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
